 ['Which thesis most effectively responds to a question about preserving historic buildings?',['Historic buildings should usually be protected, although reuse may be preferable when it keeps them safe and publicly useful.','Old buildings are always beautiful.','New buildings are always more useful.','History is important to everyone.'],0,'The response makes a clear judgement and states a sensible condition.']
